## Cable & Telco Industry

Enabling Digital Transformation in Cable & Telco

Pure Integration supports cable and telco companies with end-to-end technology solutions including design, deployment, and ongoing management of complex network infrastructure. Our team of specialized engineers brings deep expertise in telecommunications, enabling seamless integration of new technologies into existing frameworks.

### Key Capabilities in Cable & Telco

**Network Design and Planning**

Pure Integration expertly designs and plans scalable, high-performance networks tailored to the unique needs of cable and telco providers. This includes thorough analysis and strategic planning for fiber optic, HFC, and IP/MPLS networks, ensuring optimal coverage, capacity, and reliability.

**OSP Engineering and Design**

Pure Integration delivers expert OSP (Outside Plant) engineering and design services, encompassing the complete lifecycle of physical network infrastructure. This includes aerial and underground fiber deployment, conduit systems, splice locations, and detailed construction documentation.

**Technology Integration and Deployment**

From initial assessment to final deployment, Pure Integration handles comprehensive integration projects, including fiber-to-the-premises (FTTP) and distributed access architecture (DAA) deployments.

**Ongoing Network Management and Optimization**

Leveraging advanced monitoring and analytics tools, Pure Integration provides continuous network management and optimization services to ensure peak performance and reliability.

### **Why Choose Pure Integration?**

**Industry Expertise**: Pure Integration's engineers bring years of specialized experience in cable and telco, ensuring that our clients benefit from the latest advancements and best practices in the industry.

**Custom Solutions**: We understand that each client has unique needs. Pure Integration tailors its solutions to address specific challenges, from large-scale fiber rollouts to targeted technology enhancements.

**Proven Track Record**: Our extensive portfolio of successful projects across various sectors demonstrates our ability to deliver complex solutions reliably and efficiently.

**End-to-End Service**: We provide comprehensive services from consulting and design through deployment and ongoing management, ensuring a seamless experience and consistent quality throughout the project lifecycle.

### **Cable & Telco Solutions**

**Fiber Optic Infrastructure**

Pure Integration offers comprehensive fiber optic infrastructure services, including design, installation, and management of fiber networks. Our team specializes in various fiber configurations, from single-mode to multi-mode, ensuring optimal performance for both short and long-distance communications.

**HFC Network Solutions**

We provide robust HFC (Hybrid Fiber-Coaxial) network solutions, offering design, optimization, and management of hybrid networks that efficiently combine the capabilities of fiber optic and coaxial cable technologies.

**IP/MPLS Network Design**

Our IP/MPLS network design services cover the full spectrum of planning, implementing, and managing scalable and reliable IP/MPLS networks, suitable for a wide range of applications from enterprise connectivity to service provider backbone networks.

**DAA (Distributed Access Architecture)**

Pure Integration excels in implementing DAA solutions, including Remote-PHY and Remote-MAC-PHY architectures, crucial for modernizing HFC networks to increase capacity and improve service delivery.

**Fronthaul and Backhaul Solutions**

We design and implement fronthaul and backhaul solutions for mobile and fixed network operators, ensuring robust connectivity from access points to core networks, with a focus on reliability and scalability.

**GPON/XGS-PON Architecture**

Pure Integration provides specialized services in GPON and XGS-PON technologies, enabling high-speed fiber to the premises solutions. Our expertise covers design, deployment, and management of PON architectures.

**Network Topology Design and Analysis**

Our services include detailed network topology design and analysis, helping clients to optimize their network infrastructure for maximum efficiency, scalability, and reliability.

**Structured Cabling and Physical Layer Solutions**

Pure Integration offers structured cabling and physical layer solutions to establish a reliable foundation for network communications, adhering to the latest industry standards for cable management, testing, and documentation.

