## OSP Engineering

Our OSP engineering teams focus on designing, deploying, and operating complex outside plant networks for cable operators and telcos.

### Key Capabilities

**Make-Ready Engineering**

Pure Integration provides comprehensive make-ready engineering services to prepare existing infrastructure for new fiber deployments. Our make-ready assessments and designs ensure that utility poles and conduits are ready to support new installations, meeting safety and regulatory standards.

**Strand Mapping**

Pure Integration's strand mapping services provide accurate documentation and analysis of existing fiber optic strands. Our team uses specialized tools to map and verify the status of each strand in a network, ensuring that all fibers are accounted for and optimally utilized.

**Fiber Design and Engineering**

Pure Integration provides full-lifecycle fiber optic network design, from initial planning through permitting and into the detailed design phase. Our team specializes in creating designs for GPON and XGS-PON networks, tailored to the specific needs of cable operators and telcos.

**Network Documentation and Recordkeeping**

Our network documentation and recordkeeping services provide comprehensive and accurate records of network infrastructure. This includes creating and maintaining detailed schematics, diagrams, and databases of network components, configurations, and topologies.

**Construction Drawing Production**

Pure Integration specializes in producing detailed construction drawings for network infrastructure projects. These drawings provide the necessary guidance for installation teams, covering all aspects of the physical network layout.

**Permitting**

Our permitting services streamline the process of obtaining necessary approvals for network installations. We work with local authorities to ensure compliance with regulations, handling all documentation and coordination to ensure the project can proceed without unnecessary delays.

### Why Pure Integration for OSP?

**Experienced Team**: Our engineers have extensive backgrounds in cable and telco industries, with deep expertise in OSP design and implementation.

**Cutting-Edge Tools**: We utilize the latest technology and design tools to provide accurate and efficient engineering services.

**Comprehensive Service**: From make-ready engineering to construction drawing production, we offer a full suite of OSP services.

**Quality Assurance**: We implement rigorous QA processes to ensure all designs and documents meet the highest standards.

**Agile and Adaptive**: Our team is adept at handling changes and challenges, ensuring project success despite unforeseen complications.

**Compliance and Safety**: We prioritize compliance with all relevant regulations and safety standards.

